From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: add announcements list to the welcome page

Renders a VSCodium announcements section on the getting started page, fetching extra entries from the project's repository so news can reach users without shipping an app update (#1274). A `workbench.welcomePage.extraAnnouncements` machine setting gates the online request (#2335), and the fetch falls back to the built-in list so the welcome page still opens when offline (#1493).

Co-authored-by: scientificworld <30764166+scientificworld@users.noreply.github.com>

